WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.930
THE BATTLE OF THE CAPITAL

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.730
"The Battle of the Capital".

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:40.460
Look at you! You've gotten heavy!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.930
There we go. You've taken good care of him, Suzy.

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:45.360
My turn!

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.800
Look how strong he is, now!

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:53.300
So... Why did Cronicle and Miss Katejina come here?

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:56.600
So Shahkti could meet her real mother.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:59.230
Her real mother?! She's here?

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:01.130
Cronicle found her.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:02.930
In that apartment.

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:04.460
Really?

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.430
They're meeting in that apartment?

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.860
The chronology of her arrival on Earth,

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:20.760
as well as the results of the her voice print, retinal scan, and blood analysis.

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:28.100
I knew it had to be her from the moment I saw her.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.400
Forgive me.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:35.160
Cronicle, you wouldn't understand a mother's intuition.

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:38.200
I doubt any man could.

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:40.360
That's not right, either.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.600
My mother is...

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:54.200
My mother in Kasarelia is my only real mother.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.660
Your mother sent you to Earth...

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:17.160
...because she was thinking of your safety, Shahkti.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:22.100
But now that she's queen, she can protect you.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.830
You've been on the battlefield all this time?

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:26.730
Yes!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:33.100
This frail child has slipped through the fires of war,

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.730
having seen many people die around her.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.700
From now on, your mother will protect you.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:44.100
You want to go back to that battlefield?!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.930
Shahkti...

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:03.100
You've grown so.

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:07.060
Let me embrace you, Shahkti.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.160
You've suffered so much.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.460
The hidden camera's working well.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:29.160
Shahkti's finally ready to talk.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.330
It's a genuinely touching scene.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.760
This will let us certify with the public...

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.300
...that Shahkti and Maria are mother and daughter.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.100
What's wrong, Katejina?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.630
And what are your ambitions in all this?

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:47.630
To use my position as Maria's brother...

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:51.360
...to establish a matriarchy, as proposed by Fonse Kagatie.

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:55.800
Because Zanscare is still a complete patriarchy.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.400
If she's "Princess Shahkti,"

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:01.200
can't she use her influence to make Zanscare a better place?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.700
Shut up! Where do you think we are?!

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.600
Watch what you say!

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:08.900
Suzy, they let you go free because...

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:10.560
...you're Shahkti's playmate, right?

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:11.960
Right.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:14.330
Hey, Üso, you're going to see Shahkti, right?

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:18.130
How would I? We've been waiting, and they still haven't come out.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.330
Things must be going well with her mother.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.460
Look!

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:26.300
What? Oh, no! A Capital Guard patrol's coming!

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:27.800
Are they looking for us?!

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:31.160
If they ask us for ID cards, we'll just have to run!

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:31.900
There's more!

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:34.100
Arrest anyone without an ID card!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.460
We'll have to try running from them.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.200
What do you mean run?

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.860
Are you gonna have an excuse ready if they search the clinic?!

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:45.800
No, but... There must be some place we can hide.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.460
Take care of Martina!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:49.160
Suzy, what about you?

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:54.160
I'll go back to where Shahkti is. Cronicle's there, so I'll be all right.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:58.530
Hey, you!

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:01.160
I've spotted some suspicious-looking kids!

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.160
They're headed for South block!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:09.000
Split up. I'll get back into space and use the Gundam!

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.960
We don't need to raise that much hell!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.560
But we need to meet up in that garage, right?

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:14.400
I see!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.360
Let's go!

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:50.560
It may be a modified spaceship,

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:55.360
but this Reineforce Junior is even stronger than the original Reineforce!

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:56.360
Understood?

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:59.230
Roger! All turret tests, complete!

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:03.930
Mobile suit decks 1, 2, and 3, ready to launch mobile suits!

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:04.960
Roger!

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.730
Attention all hands, stand by for orders from the captain.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:08.760
Go ahead, sir.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:12.500
This will be the Reineforce Junior's first battle.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:17.660
Since this ship is a rushed refit, we'll need to get used to it for now.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:18.560
Okay?

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.730
We are launching an air raid on...

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:24.630
...the Zanscare homeland in the former colony of Ameria.

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:27.560
Do not attack anything besides military facilities!

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:28.460
Roger!

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.860
Shrike Team, Junko Jenko, moving out!

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:37.730
Marbet, V Gundam Hexa Unit 2! Here I go!

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.160
He ran into the alley!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.560
We need to drive him onto the street. What?!

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:58.630
Don't shoot here!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.700
A mobile suit just appeared!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.460
There it is!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.100
Where'd it go?!

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.700
There it is!

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:16.300
Air Guard, can't you see there are unknown mobile suits...

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:18.460
...attacking Georgia Street?!

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:19.860
Haro, this way!

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:22.160
There it is!

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.900
That was... Halt!

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:30.460
You little...

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.930
You think they got away?

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.430
What's going on?

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:40.930
Nothing! I just took Karl for a little walk.

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:43.600
I see. Well, just wait a little longer.

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:46.430
I think it's about time for the two of you to get out of here.

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.300
I'll call for the car.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:09.900
Looks like you've caused even more trouble.

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:12.600
That seems to be our main duty.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:15.660
As things stand, we need to get moving and rendezvous with Üso.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.460
But, we can't leave Martina here.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:21.030
We can ask the clinic to look after her.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.400
I feel sorry for her.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.230
What do you think?

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:33.830
It's okay. Proceed.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.300
Okay!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.930
They don't give up!

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.560
You get in here.

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:07.330
We need to move.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.830
You should not move.

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:11.460
They'll find the place where Martina is.

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:13.900
Probability of escape is, um...

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:15.630
Probably about 90% impossible.

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.130
Unless we make contact with Mr. Václav and the others,

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.360
we don't even know which direction to run.

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:26.630
I don't want to be alone.

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:27.800
Shahkti...

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:32.060
Shahkti and I are staying in a place that's like a castle.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:36.430
Now you're a princess in a castle, Shahkti?

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.460
That's it!

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:48.830
Electric shocks?!

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:51.400
Arm circuits, shorted!

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:53.030
I can't move my left arm!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.160
If I can electrocute the pilot, I can take the suit!

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.000
Can't I do anything?!

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:09.760
Haro! Haro! Üso! Do your best! Do your best!

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:12.830
Haro!

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:18.860
This Gundam replica is no match for me, now that I've powered up!

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:29.400
Dammit!

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:34.860
I got careless and moved too much! Now there are enemies all around me!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.400
From behind?!

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:48.100
I'm caught!

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.430
If we attack the Zanscare,

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:08.060
we'll be saving the Side 2 Alliance Space Fleet?

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.400
Is that what you're saying?

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:12.800
Because it'll draw the attention of the Zanscare Main Fleet that's...

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.300
...engaging the Alliance Fleet back to their homeland.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:18.460
Draw the Zanscare Main Fleet's attention to their homeland?

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:19.430
You don't understand?

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.400
No.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:23.900
The Side 2 Alliance Fleet has been routed.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:28.160
So, they want us to distract the Zanscare's main fleet...

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.230
...so that the survivors can escape.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:36.230
Otherwise, they'll kill the survivors, as well.

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:39.460
Which would leave the League Militaire's rear unprotected.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.460
Hence this air raid. It's time.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:47.860
Hey, is there some kind of exercise going on?

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:49.130
Not that I've heard.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.400
Mobile suits entering the port, what is your posting?

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.260
I told you, it's an enemy raid!

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:10.760
Send out the Squid's mobile suit forces.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:15.100
What the hell are the Yellow Jacket HQ forces doing?!

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.760
Most of them are student soldiers! Our main forces are...

00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:20.530
We have the Capital Guard! And they know the area!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:23.860
Ah, Cronicle. You wasted no time.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.630
I could tell you about the trip over, but I'll head out, instead.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.060
Thank you. Please, do.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:28.760
Sir!

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:32.500
There's a raid going on outside.

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:36.430
Good! If we assist, we can sell the Sandhoge to the military!

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.860
How's the Zanscare defense line doing?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.960
Haro, getting out of here comes first. Sorry.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:57.860
Give me your bulkhead access codes!

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:04.660
You were kind enough to tell me, so sorry about this.

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.200
Please, work!

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.960
Good! The automatics started up!

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:33.260
Those are League Militaire mobile suits! Are they from the Reineforce?

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:44.430
Cronicle, launching! I'll head for the port at once!

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.660
Amalthea 11, make for the solar power port!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.500
Roger!

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:51.800
Let's go!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:58.100
So, the attackers are from the Reineforce, after all!

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:04.260
What?! They've breached the hull?! What are our troops doing?!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:10.460
They're fighting in the space colony?! In the Zanscare Empire?!

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:19.330
You see that, you flying pair of legs?!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:21.760
No, you don't! I'm not dead yet!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.530
He was still able to bail out?!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:34.730
He hid?

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:51.430
You should be happy that you met your real mother, Shahkti.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.600
That's what I think.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:00.830
I'm not making you feel better, am I?

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:04.460
I wish Üso could have come to see you.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:05.900
Üso!

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:08.700
Üso is calling me!

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:10.930
Wait!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:13.560
Princess! Where are you going?!

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:21.160
I've drifted into another block... A castle?

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.500
Could that be... Haro!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:34.600
It's Üso! Üso's come!

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:35.760
Üso!

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:38.100
You mustn't!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.130
Please, return to your room. The enemy's approaching!

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.300
But...

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.030
I knew it!

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.330
Here he comes! Please, get back!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.530
Üso?

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:00.200
It's no use! I can't shoot back from here!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.430
Üso? Üso, is that you?

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:05.300
What are you doing here?!

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.600
There's something special here, isn't there?

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.260
You can explain later!

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:16.260
They're trying to land on the castle grounds!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.130
Don't fall back! Defend this spot!

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:26.000
Üso came? Who's in the one without the horns?

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:27.200
I don't know.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:29.600
Üso!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:32.760
Üso...

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:35.560
Shahkti!

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:36.700
Üso!

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:39.730
So, you met your mother, huh?

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:40.800
I'm glad!

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:46.230
You'll be happy, now that you've met your real mom.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:48.760
You think so?

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.600
Why would you say that?

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.130
Is your mother a bad person or something?

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.630
She's really nice.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.530
Then it's okay, right?

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:02.560
But, she's the Queen of Zanscare. I'll be your enemy now.

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:03.960
Maybe, but...

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:08.230
That may be your position now, but she's definitely your mother.

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:09.800
I know!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:14.530
Your mom must need help! Isn't that why you met her?

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:16.260
My help?

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:20.430
Being queen is hard work, so she wants you at her side!

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:22.600
You think so?

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:26.700
Shahkti is Maria's daughter?! This is incredible!

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.000
Üso!

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:34.230
Suzy, take care of Shahkti!

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:34.860
Üso!

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:38.600
No! You can't get in their way now!

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:42.760
Üso...

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:02.100
Üso, escaping the space colony will be difficult!

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:12.560
Oliver, I've recovered, Üso!

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:15.060
Yeah. Was the raid successful?

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:18.930
Right, it's just us left in here.

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:34.860
Peggie! Cony! We're pulling out!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.060
We've done enough diversion for today.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:41.630
What?! The people from the Aeneas are in the colony, too?

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:42.760
Yeah!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:46.460
I need to cover Odelo and the others when they move!

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:50.200
Üso, use my Hanger and Oliver's Boots.

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:57.600
Thanks!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:04.360
Forget it. If we go out now, they'll spot us.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.530
What do we do?

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:09.000
We managed to sneak Martina in here, but now we can't get out?!

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:10.400
Tomáš!

00:20:10.530 --> 00:20:11.530
Here they come!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.100
Doesn't the Fishbone have any weapons?!

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:18.200
If we use missiles in here...

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.530
Let's surrender! We can surrender, for now!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:23.330
A white Sinope and a ship I've never seen before.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:24.330
What is this?

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.130
T-The controls!

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.530
We can't keep up with the colony's centrifugal force!

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.230
What's that? Is the white one back?!

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:39.430
I'll guide you! Please, follow me!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:40.430
Üso!

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:41.600
Please do!

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.730
The Reineforce Junior is close by!

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.660
More pursuers?!

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:55.500
My compliments on assembling your fake Gundams here in the homeland!

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:58.330
What?

00:20:58.360 --> 00:20:59.360
You're mine!

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.230
How long can you last?!

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:14.560
Might for might!

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:24.100
That's one hell of a handy way to use it.

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:32.930
Well done, League Militaire.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:34.800
In just a few hours,

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:37.600
you managed a raid on the Zanscare homeland.

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:41.700
Can you fix him?

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:45.730
No promises, but I'll do what I can.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:46.700
Please do.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:49.100
Get well soon, Haro.

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:51.260
Here you are!

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:51.860
What?

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:54.100
We're having a rendezvous party!

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:57.600
And we're discussing how to get Martina back out of there.

00:21:57.630 --> 00:21:59.060
Sure. Tell me all about it.

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:00.300
You too, Mr. Otis!

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:01.800
Sure!

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:07.930
Shahkti... Was leaving you there a good idea?

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:35.100
Everyone was worried about Shahkti being left in Zanscare.

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:40.200
Üso and the others sneak into a fleet docking at the homeland,

00:23:40.360 --> 00:23:42.900
intending to infiltrate the colony.

00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:48.930
It's there that Üso meets Queen Maria.

00:23:51.100 --> 00:23:54.030
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:54.060 --> 00:23:55.060
"To Enemy Ships and Enemy Lands".

00:23:55.060 --> 00:23:57.100
